# ThreadSanitizer suppressions.
#
# QtCore is not instrumented, so TSan cannot see the synchronisation inside Qt's event queue. The
# slot object of a queued call is written by the posting thread and read by the receiving thread.
# All data that crosses threads goes through std::mutex (QcMailbox, QcWorkerPool), which TSan does
# see; queued calls only carry the wake-up itself.
race_top:QtPrivate::QCallableObject
race_top:QtPrivate::QSlotObjectBase
